     ],
     "summary": "Execute the Unicycle Setup function to bootstrap Sneed. Executing this proposal will:\nMark the neuron b8aea533371402076b6555759fb4236ecca165508de057f5ecdc6343e06ddf43 as the source of Unicycle backend proposals (e.g. proposals for configuration changes proposed by Unicycle Sneed admins, proposals for ICP transfers to fund topups, etc).\nRegister 12 custom functions for interacting with Unicycle config to allow any Sneed staker to propose configuration changes that the DAO may vote on.\nNext steps after this proposal and the 12 registration proposals pass will be to set admins and an initial configuration for automatic transfers of funds to sneed's unicycle deposit account.\n--------------------------------\n<br><br>\nThis proposal was created using [https://ic-toolkit.app](https://ic-toolkit.app)\n<br><br>\n"
